flowchart LR
    OP[Operator]
    SYS((OMNISENT Application))
    HW[ESP8266 and Arduino Robot]
    PY[Python Voice / Camera Service]
    DB[(Mission and Event Store)]
    OP -->|Commands and mission actions| SYS
    SYS -->|Validated commands| HW
    HW -->|Connection and robot status| SYS
    SYS -->|Capture or recognition request| PY
    PY -->|Image reference, result, or error| SYS
    SYS -->|Create/update records| DB
    DB -->|Mission history| SYS
    SYS -->|Status, history, errors| OP
